english	PAYTABLES
{ui.info_page_1_text_1`
englishUAll symbols pay from left to right on adjacent reels starting from the leftmost reel.
1ui.info_page_2_title
englishWILD SYMBOLS
¶ui.info_page_2_text_1ä
englishThis is the WILD symbol and substitutes for all symbols except for SCATTER and Jackpot Key. It appears only on reel 2, 3 and 4.
÷ui.info_page_2_text_2∫
englishÆThese are EXPAND WILD symbols. They appear only on reels 2, 3 and 4 and only in the FREE GAME.

During the round any WILD symbol that hits, if there would be any win after expansion, it expands the whole reel vertically and get random multiplier. Possible values are 1x, 2x, 3x, 4x, 5x, 6x, 7x, 8x, 9x or 10x and will remain on the screen until the end of the round, for all free spins.

The multiplier applies to all winning combinations that it is part of. If more than one WILD is part of the same winning combination, their multipliers add to each other.
.ui.info_page_3_title
english	FREE GAME
Ûui.info_page_3_text_1◊
englishÀThese are SCATTER symbols. SCATTER symbols appear only on reels 1, 3, and 5 in the base game.
Hit 3 SCATTER symbols on these reels to trigger the FREE GAME and award
<color=#C9FF6B>7</color> free spins.

During the round any WILD symbol that hits, if there would be any win after expansion, get a random multiplier from the same possible values and will remain on the screen until the end of the round, for all free spins.

The feature cannot be re-triggered.
